You should

861
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:49,590
try another hospital,

862
00:34:49,590 --> 00:34:50,320
Okay?

863
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:52,190
I've already tried them all.

864
00:34:52,480 --> 00:34:53,760
Look, otherwise, I...

865
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:57,110
Otherwise, you wouldn't
have come to Xiaoximen Hospital,

866
00:34:57,110 --> 00:34:57,840
right?

867
00:34:58,480 --> 00:34:59,440
I'm telling you,

868
00:34:59,630 --> 00:35:00,920
even if Xiaoximen Hospital
isn't the best hospital,

869
00:35:00,920 --> 00:35:02,110
it's still a legitimate hospital.

870
00:35:02,110 --> 00:35:03,710
We're not some shady clinic.

871
00:35:03,710 --> 00:35:04,550
Here's what you should do:

872
00:35:04,550 --> 00:35:05,550
contact your family

873
00:35:05,550 --> 00:35:06,680
as soon as possible.

874
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:08,290
Brain surgery is different

875
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,510
from surgery on other parts of the body.

876
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:11,920
It's better to have a family member
here with you.

877
00:35:11,920 --> 00:35:12,920
That way, we'll all feel more at ease,

878
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:13,440
right?

879
00:35:16,360 --> 00:35:18,030
Let me think about it some more.

880
00:35:18,030 --> 00:35:19,150
Yes, yes, it's that same issue.

881
00:35:19,150 --> 00:35:19,920
Listen,

882
00:35:20,670 --> 00:35:22,000
can you find a way

883
00:35:22,320 --> 00:35:23,050
to come over?

884
00:35:24,150 --> 00:35:25,230
Seriously,

885
00:35:26,710 --> 00:35:27,770
I'm at my wit's end.

886
00:35:29,150 --> 00:35:30,920
I just can't find anyone else.

887
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,070
I thought he'd left,

888
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:33,280
but he was in the observation room

889
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:34,030
making calls the whole time.

890
00:35:34,030 --> 00:35:36,030
He kept calling until he passed out.

891
00:35:36,480 --> 00:35:38,670
Can we activate
the emergency protocol

892
00:35:38,670 --> 00:35:41,960
and have the hospital's chief duty officer
sign the consent for now?

893
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:43,960
We have to follow the proper procedures.

894
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:46,070
That'll take some time.

895
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:47,590
He can't wait.

896
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:48,390
I understand.

897
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:51,930
Then let's do both
at the same time.

898
00:35:52,190 --> 00:35:53,480
We'll start
the formal application process,

899
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:54,880
and we'll call the police

900
00:35:54,960 --> 00:35:56,000
right away

901
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,150
to help locate his family.

902
00:35:57,150 --> 00:35:58,590
If a family member arrives
and can sign the consent,

903
00:35:58,590 --> 00:36:00,030
we can proceed with the surgery.

904
00:36:00,030 --> 00:36:00,920
Whichever

905
00:36:01,110 --> 00:36:02,040
works out first.

906
00:36:02,710 --> 00:36:03,280
Okay.

907
00:36:05,960 --> 00:36:07,440
Keep an eye on him. I'll make a call.

908
00:36:07,440 --> 00:36:08,030
Okay.

909
00:36:09,630 --> 00:36:11,150
I've got him under control, Junnan.

910
00:36:11,150 --> 00:36:12,440
Just use the second skill.

911
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:13,070
I'm telling you,

912
00:36:13,070 --> 00:36:14,480
their jungler's coming to gank.

913
00:36:14,480 --> 00:36:16,340
Use your skill to block him for me.

914
00:36:16,440 --> 00:36:17,320
Block him!

915
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:18,190
Block him!

916
00:36:18,480 --> 00:36:19,440
Block him!

917
00:36:21,050 --> 00:36:22,200
[Liu Zhengliang]

918
00:36:22,030 --> 00:36:22,670
Hold on.

919
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:23,480
Wait, wait.

920
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:24,110
Okay.

921
00:36:28,510 --> 00:36:29,230
Hello?

922
00:36:29,230 --> 00:36:30,360
I've got a patient

923
00:36:29,310 --> 00:36:35,170
[Emergency]

924
00:36:30,360 --> 00:36:31,320
in critical condition here

925
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:32,800
who needs emergency surgery.

926
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:34,400
I need to contact his family.

927
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,070
How do you

928
00:36:36,070 --> 00:36:37,590
usually handle a situation like this?

929
00:36:37,590 --> 00:36:38,960
I'm, uh, playing a game

930
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:40,490
with Zhengguang right now.

931
00:36:41,110 --> 00:36:42,840
Wait for me. I'll be right over.

932
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:44,400
What's up, Junnan?

933
00:36:44,400 --> 00:36:45,590
Your brother needs me for something.

934
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:47,070
I'll head over there first.

935
00:36:47,070 --> 00:36:48,670
Junnan, I'm in my promotion match!

936
00:36:48,670 --> 00:36:49,510
I would've

937
00:36:49,630 --> 00:36:50,920
played solo queue...

938
00:36:58,500 --> 00:37:01,440
[Surgical Inpatient Department]

939
00:36:58,880 --> 00:36:59,800
Why aren't you at work?

940
00:36:59,800 --> 00:37:01,000
I'll explain later.

941
00:37:01,070 --> 00:37:02,150
Where's the patient?

942
00:37:02,150 --> 00:37:03,680
In the resuscitation room.

943
00:37:04,070 --> 00:37:05,670
I've dealt with this before.

944
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:07,880
First, use the patient's phone
to contact his family.

945
00:37:07,880 --> 00:37:08,710
Where's his phone?

946
00:37:08,710 --> 00:37:09,480
We have his phone,

947
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:11,030
but the nurse said it's locked
with a passcode.

948
00:37:11,030 --> 00:37:11,840
Here it is.

949
00:37:17,070 --> 00:37:18,000
Come take a look.

950
00:37:21,150 --> 00:37:22,280
This guy's pretty up-to-date.

951
00:37:22,280 --> 00:37:24,410
He's got facial recognition enabled.

952
00:37:24,670 --> 00:37:25,670
Can you unlock it?

953
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:29,060
Why didn't he just use a fingerprint?

954
00:37:29,550 --> 00:37:31,320
Could we get someone to hack into it?

955
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:32,960
There's no time.

956
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:35,110
How about holding it up to his face?

957
00:37:35,110 --> 00:37:36,400
Try to see if it'll unlock.

958
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:37,190
It won't.

959
00:37:38,070 --> 00:37:39,480
His eyes have to be open.

960
00:37:39,590 --> 00:37:40,070
Wait,

961
00:37:40,550 --> 00:37:43,010
how can we open his eyes
if he's unconscious?

962
00:37:44,550 --> 00:37:45,320
Who says an unconscious person

963
00:37:45,320 --> 00:37:46,580
can't open their eyes?

964
00:37:47,590 --> 00:37:48,400
Relax.

965
00:37:48,510 --> 00:37:49,640
Just follow my lead.

966
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:51,110
When I count down three, two, one,

967
00:37:51,110 --> 00:37:51,880
you two pull his eyelids open

968
00:37:51,880 --> 00:37:52,960
at the same time.

969
00:37:53,230 --> 00:37:53,800
Come on.

970
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:55,230
Get ready.

971
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:57,880
Three, two, one!

972
00:37:59,800 --> 00:38:01,000
Did it unlock? Check.

973
00:38:02,190 --> 00:38:02,800
Nope.

974
00:38:03,670 --> 00:38:05,070
Maybe we're doing it wrong.

975
00:38:05,070 --> 00:38:06,400
Is this phone too smart?

976
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,590
C-Can it tell his eyelids

977
00:38:07,590 --> 00:38:09,400
are being forced open

978
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,800
instead of opening naturally?

979
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:12,110
It's not that smart!

980
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:13,960
You need to hold his eyelids

981
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:14,880
open wider.

982
00:38:15,510 --> 00:38:16,190
Let's try again.

983
00:38:16,190 --> 00:38:17,520
Put some muscle into it!

984
00:38:20,630 --> 00:38:22,320
Three, two, one.

985
00:38:26,510 --> 00:38:27,230
There aren't any contacts

986
00:38:27,230 --> 00:38:28,710
labeled

987
00:38:28,710 --> 00:38:30,400
as parents, family, children,

988
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:31,030
or anything like that.

989
00:38:31,030 --> 00:38:32,510
If there's no label,

990
00:38:32,960 --> 00:38:34,190
open his contacts

991
00:38:34,190 --> 00:38:34,920
and check

992
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:36,070
who he's called

993
00:38:36,070 --> 00:38:36,920
most often.

994
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:37,440
Recent calls.

995
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:38,640
Right, recent calls.

996
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:40,440
See who he calls the most. You...

997
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:41,710
Here, "Honey 13."

998
00:38:42,630 --> 00:38:43,880
C-Call this one.

999
00:38:42,680 --> 00:38:43,400
[All Calls]

1000
00:38:43,470 --> 00:38:44,470
[Honey13]

1001
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:45,070
Let's call this one.
They talk a lot.

1002
00:38:45,070 --> 00:38:46,440
Tell her who you are.

1003
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:47,150
Tell her where you're from.

1004
00:38:47,150 --> 00:38:47,510
I make the call?

1005
00:38:47,510 --> 00:38:48,770
N-No. I'm not calling.

1006
00:38:49,000 --> 00:38:49,960
Come on, come on.

1007
00:38:50,030 --> 00:38:52,430
It'll help you practice talking to people.

1008
00:38:54,550 --> 00:38:55,610
The ringback tone.

1009
00:38:55,920 --> 00:38:56,760
Didn't I tell you?

1010
00:38:56,760 --> 00:38:58,030
I'm not going. I'm not going.

1011
00:38:58,030 --> 00:38:59,230
Don't call me again.

1012
00:38:59,710 --> 00:39:01,280
Wait, it's Liu Zhengliang. Hone—

1013
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,030
Tell her where you're calling from.

1014
00:39:02,030 --> 00:39:03,760
I'm a doctor in the emergency department

1015
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:05,150
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

1016
00:39:05,360 --> 00:39:06,630
Do you know Kang Sheng?

1017
00:39:06,630 --> 00:39:08,150
What? Is Kang Sheng dead?

1018
00:39:08,510 --> 00:39:09,840
No, no, he's not dead.

1019
00:39:09,960 --> 00:39:11,760
He needs emergency surgery right away.

1020
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:12,960
He's in the hospital?

1021
00:39:13,110 --> 00:39:13,970
I'm not coming.

1022
00:39:14,670 --> 00:39:15,440
It's urgent?

1023
00:39:15,440 --> 00:39:16,590
Then I'm definitely not coming.

1024
00:39:16,590 --> 00:39:17,230
What does it have to do with me?

1025
00:39:17,230 --> 00:39:18,000
It does concern you,

1026
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:19,880
because we need someone

1027
00:39:20,190 --> 00:39:21,000
to come and—

1028
00:39:21,110 --> 00:39:21,800
Call disconnected.

1029
00:39:21,800 --> 00:39:23,710
Scroll up. See if there's
anyone further down.

1030
00:39:23,710 --> 00:39:24,440
Scroll up

1031
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,590
and see if there's anyone else.

1032
00:39:25,590 --> 00:39:26,280
Here.

1033
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:28,280
Kang Yun. Same last name.

1034
00:39:28,280 --> 00:39:28,800
-Yes.
-And.

1035
00:39:28,800 --> 00:39:29,510
it could be his son.

1036
00:39:29,510 --> 00:39:30,480
They talk a lot.

1037
00:39:32,840 --> 00:39:33,630
Hello.

1038
00:39:33,670 --> 00:39:35,110
I'm Liu Zhengliang,

1039
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:36,150
a doctor in the emergency department

1040
00:39:36,150 --> 00:39:37,670
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

1041
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:39,140
Do you know Kang Sheng?

1042
00:39:40,190 --> 00:39:41,150
I'm his brother.

1043
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,510
Hello, hello!

1044
00:39:43,510 --> 00:39:44,280
Thank goodness.

1045
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:44,800
Here's the situation: Mr. Kang

1046
00:39:44,800 --> 00:39:45,710
needs emergency surgery

1047
00:39:45,710 --> 00:39:46,360
right away.

1048
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:47,030
So we need someone

1049
00:39:47,030 --> 00:39:47,630
to come over
and sign the consent form for him.

1050
00:39:47,630 --> 00:39:49,320
How much are you paying me?

1051
00:39:49,550 --> 00:39:50,480
This isn't about money.

1052
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,610
It's about his life!

1053
00:39:51,670 --> 00:39:52,280
-It's about saving his life!
-If

1054
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:53,360
you don't sign the consent,

1055
00:39:53,360 --> 00:39:53,800
his life

1056
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:54,630
could be in danger.

1057
00:39:54,630 --> 00:39:56,800
If there's no money in it for me,

1058
00:39:57,000 --> 00:40:00,000
why are you calling?
You're making me lose money here!

1059
00:40:00,110 --> 00:40:01,070
Is that really his own brother?

1060
00:40:01,070 --> 00:40:02,930
Try another one. Try another one.

1061
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:05,190
Y-You talk to her. Go on,

1062
00:40:05,190 --> 00:40:06,510
You can explain it better.

1063
00:40:06,510 --> 00:40:08,840
Hello, Hone— Um...

1064
00:40:09,150 --> 00:40:09,920
Xiaoximen!

1065
00:40:09,920 --> 00:40:10,230
Right.

1066
00:40:10,230 --> 00:40:11,760
I-I'm from Xiaoximen Hospital.

1067
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:13,150
My name is Liu Zhengliang.

1068
00:40:13,150 --> 00:40:14,360
Kang Sheng

1069
00:40:14,360 --> 00:40:15,190
has lost consciousness

1070
00:40:15,190 --> 00:40:16,000
and needs emergency treatment.

1071
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:17,510
Someone has to sign the consent form.

1072
00:40:17,510 --> 00:40:18,320
Could you come over

1073
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:19,440
and sign it for him?

1074
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,070
Oh, for heaven's sake!

1075
00:40:20,070 --> 00:40:21,190
What does he have to do with me?

1076
00:40:21,190 --> 00:40:22,030
Let him go to whoever he wants!

1077
00:40:22,030 --> 00:40:22,710
I'm telling you,

1078
00:40:22,710 --> 00:40:24,030
we're long over.

1079
00:40:24,030 --> 00:40:25,190
He always wants what he has

1080
00:40:25,190 --> 00:40:25,880
and what he doesn't have.

1081
00:40:25,880 --> 00:40:27,030
What a piece of work!

1082
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:28,590
Dating him

1083
00:40:28,590 --> 00:40:29,280
was the worst luck

1084
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:30,360
I've ever had.

1085
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:31,030
What a jerk!

1086
00:40:31,030 --> 00:40:31,360
I'm hanging up.

1087
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:32,590
Don't call me again!

1088
00:40:33,230 --> 00:40:34,030
Come on.

1089
00:40:34,590 --> 00:40:36,670
♪ Love isn't something you can sell ♪

1090
00:40:36,880 --> 00:40:38,150
♪ Just because you want to ♪

1091
00:40:38,150 --> 00:40:39,150
Keep going, keep going.

1092
00:40:39,150 --> 00:40:40,190
Honey 8.

1093
00:40:40,440 --> 00:40:41,500
I loved him so much,

1094
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:44,320
and he went and found another woman.

1095
00:40:44,630 --> 00:40:46,960
She's over twenty years younger than him.

1096
00:40:47,230 --> 00:40:48,490
What a shameless jerk!

1097
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,550
Number nine? Call number nine?

1098
00:40:53,550 --> 00:40:56,030
At first, we were neighbors by day

1099
00:40:56,360 --> 00:40:57,590
and lovers by night.

1100
00:40:57,840 --> 00:40:59,710
Then we became lovers by day

1101
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:01,150
and neighbors by night.

1102
00:41:01,670 --> 00:41:02,590
And by "lovers,"

1103
00:41:02,590 --> 00:41:04,650
I don't mean we were legally married.

1104
00:41:05,880 --> 00:41:07,800
Don't call me about signing anything.

1105
00:41:07,800 --> 00:41:09,030
I'm in Iceland.

1106
00:41:09,840 --> 00:41:11,000
Thank heavens!

1107
00:41:11,030 --> 00:41:13,000
He finally opened his eyes.

1108
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,330
I'm telling you,

1109
00:41:14,510 --> 00:41:15,960
a man like him

1110
00:41:16,150 --> 00:41:18,110
should've been—
should've been dead long ago.

1111
00:41:18,110 --> 00:41:19,480
Call another one, call another one!

1112
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:20,230
Hello,

1113
00:41:20,230 --> 00:41:21,070
this is Xiaoximen Hospital.

1114
00:41:21,070 --> 00:41:22,280
Kang Sheng is in
the emergency room right now.

1115
00:41:22,280 --> 00:41:23,320
I don't know him.

1116
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:28,000
He's got thirteen "Honey,"

1117
00:41:29,190 --> 00:41:30,590
each with a number.

1118
00:41:30,590 --> 00:41:32,030
I've seen it all now.

1119
00:41:32,230 --> 00:41:33,190
Today, I've finally learned

1120
00:41:33,190 --> 00:41:34,800
what it means to be abandoned by everyone

1121
00:41:34,800 --> 00:41:36,060
and reap what one sows.

1122
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:37,400
But honestly,

1123
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:39,840
I'm jealous.

1124
00:41:40,480 --> 00:41:42,110
So jealous.

1125
00:41:56,190 --> 00:41:57,230
Where is he?

1126
00:41:57,920 --> 00:41:59,250
Who are you looking for?

1127
00:41:59,590 --> 00:42:00,630
Didn't you ask the police

1128
00:42:00,630 --> 00:42:01,670
to find me?

1129
00:42:02,710 --> 00:42:04,240
I'm Kang Sheng's daughter.

1130
00:42:04,590 --> 00:42:06,390
He's in the resuscitation room.

1131
00:42:06,520 --> 00:42:09,940
[No Entry]

1132
00:42:09,800 --> 00:42:10,800
You may head back.

1133
00:42:12,190 --> 00:42:13,790
Call me if anything comes up.

1134
00:42:13,800 --> 00:42:14,590
Thanks.

1135
00:42:19,880 --> 00:42:20,670
Hello.

1136
00:42:20,880 --> 00:42:22,610
Hello. We need you to sign here.

1137
00:42:22,880 --> 00:42:24,010
Good thing you came.

1138
00:42:24,070 --> 00:42:26,360
Otherwise, your dad
might not have made it.

1139
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:27,150
Are you done?

1140
00:42:29,630 --> 00:42:31,160
I agree to forgo treatment.

1141
00:42:31,630 --> 00:42:32,690
No more treatment.

1142
00:42:35,150 --> 00:42:35,960
Wait,

1143
